          "title": "每",
          "content": "<p>次打开一个源码文件，你都应该让它变得更好。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://spicermatthews.com/blog/spicers-rules-on-how-and-when-to-test-your-code/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DHH</a></p>",
